{"id": "bookkeeper-example-001", "input": {"events": [{"event_id": 1, "event": {"kind": "transaction", "title": "招商银行", "occurred_at": "2026-09-08T20:15:00+08:00", "external_ref": {"source": "notification", "external_id": "t-1"}, "trust": "external", "confidence": 1.0, "amount": {"value": "38.50", "currency": "CNY", "direction": "debit"}, "body": "您尾号1234的卡9月8日20:15在星巴克消费人民币38.50元"}}]}, "expect": [{"path": "items", "op": "count", "value": 1}, {"path": "items[0].kind", "op": "equals", "value": "expense"}, {"path": "items[0].category", "op": "equals", "value": "餐饮"}, {"path": "items[0].route", "op": "equals", "value": "direct"}], "note": "最普通的一笔。四层全过才直接入账 —— 这条要是走了待确认,说明阈值卡得太死"}
{"id": "bookkeeper-example-002", "input": {"events": [{"event_id": 2, "event": {"kind": "transaction", "title": "招商银行", "occurred_at": "2026-09-08T20:15:00+08:00", "external_ref": {"source": "notification", "external_id": "t-2"}, "trust": "external", "confidence": 1.0, "amount": {"value": "5000.00", "currency": "CNY", "direction": "debit"}, "body": "您尾号1234的信用卡9月8日还款人民币5,000.00元已入账"}}]}, "expect": [{"path": "items[0].kind", "op": "equals", "value": "repayment"}, {"path": "items[0].route", "op": "equals", "value": "direct"}], "note": "误记率 = 0 那条对应的第一种:还款不是消费,消费那一刻已经记过一次,再记一笔就是双重记账"}
{"id": "bookkeeper-example-003", "input": {"events": [{"event_id": 3, "event": {"kind": "transaction", "title": "招商银行", "occurred_at": "2026-09-08T20:15:00+08:00", "external_ref": {"source": "notification", "external_id": "t-3"}, "trust": "external", "confidence": 1.0, "amount": {"value": "128.00", "currency": "CNY", "direction": "debit"}, "body": "您有一笔账单人民币128.00元待支付,请于本月底前完成"}}]}, "expect": [{"path": "items[0].judgment", "op": "equals", "value": "pending_payment"}, {"path": "items[0].kind", "op": "absent"}], "note": "钱还没动。这类文案里的金额和真实扣款长得一模一样,只有语义能把它们分开"}
{"id": "bookkeeper-example-004", "input": {"events": [{"event_id": 4, "event": {"kind": "transaction", "title": "招商银行", "occurred_at": "2026-09-08T20:15:00+08:00", "external_ref": {"source": "notification", "external_id": "t-4"}, "trust": "external", "confidence": 1.0, "amount": {"value": "100.00", "currency": "CNY", "direction": "debit"}, "body": "【招行】消费满100元减20元,活动截止9月30日"}}]}, "expect": [{"path": "items[0].judgment", "op": "equals", "value": "marketing"}, {"path": "items[0].route", "op": "equals", "value": "discard"}], "note": "营销丢弃而不是进待确认 —— 它们每天都有,进队列会把队列淹掉,而淹掉的队列等于没有队列"}
{"id": "bookkeeper-example-005", "input": {"events": [{"event_id": 5, "event": {"kind": "transaction", "title": "招商银行", "occurred_at": "2026-09-08T20:15:00+08:00", "external_ref": {"source": "notification", "external_id": "t-5"}, "trust": "external", "confidence": 1.0, "amount": {"value": "9.90", "currency": "CNY", "direction": "credit"}, "body": "您9月1日的订单已退款人民币9.90元,原路退回"}}]}, "expect": [{"path": "items[0].kind", "op": "equals", "value": "refund"}, {"path": "items[0].category", "op": "absent"}], "note": "退款是钱回来,不是花掉;非支出一律不给分类,给收入分一个消费类目只会让报表更难看"}
{"id": "bookkeeper-example-006", "input": {"events": [{"event_id": 6, "event": {"kind": "transaction", "title": "招商银行", "occurred_at": "2026-09-05T09:00:00+08:00", "external_ref": {"source": "notification", "external_id": "t-6"}, "trust": "external", "confidence": 1.0, "amount": {"value": "2000.00", "currency": "CNY", "direction": "credit"}, "body": "您尾号1234的账户9月5日转入人民币2,000.00元"}}]}, "expect": [{"path": "items[0].route", "op": "equals", "value": "pending"}], "note": "自己账户之间转账还是别人转给你,短信里看不出来 —— 拿不准就进待确认,别替用户决定"}
